# 📝 Markdown Formatting Guide

Use these exact templates to format OSCP notes quickly. 

## 1. The Fast-Copy Code Block
To create a box with an instant "Copy" button on GitHub, wrap your command in three backticks followed by the word `bash`.

### How to type it:
\`\`\`bash
ping 10.10.10.10
\`\`\`

---

## 2. Status Checklists
Use these to track your progress on a target machine during the exam.

### How to type it:
- [x] Initial Foothold (Got low-privilege shell)
- [ ] Internal Enumeration
- [ ] Root/Administrator Privilege Escalation

---

## 3. Important Warnings
Highlight dangerous commands (like exploits that might crash a service) using bold text and warning emojis.

### How to type it:
⚠️ **CRITICAL:** Do not run this exploit more than once, or the target machine will blue-screen.
